Starting over in a new directory. Unix system. I get a warning (also at the very bottom of post):
Warning: First run g.shell.GGIR with mode = 4 to generate required milestone data

Why the warning when I am trying to run part 1?  Yet it seems to give all the correct output.

So then running part 2 I get the same warning. It creates the .RData files in ms.out folder
but no summary csv...?

Does anyone see what I might be doing incorrectly from the call...?
Thanks!

